        864.85,
        400.27
      ],
      "geometry": "rect",
      "text": "* Stock market analysis is important for making informed investment and financial decisions.\n* Traditional stock analysis methods often require knowledge of programming, APIs, and data visualization tools.\n* These technical requirements make stock analysis difficult for students, beginner investors, and non-technical users.\n* Understanding market trends and stock performance can be challenging without specialized skills.\n* Recent advancements in Artificial Intelligence (AI) and Large Language Models (LLMs) have simplified data interaction through natural language.\n* Users can now ask questions in plain English instead of writing complex code.\n* This project presents an AI-powered financial analysis system for stock market analysis.\n* The system retrieves real-time stock market data and processes user queries intelligently.\n* It automatically generates insights, trends, and visualizations based on the requested stock information.\n* The platform makes financial analysis more accessible, interactive, and user-friendly.\n* It helps users make better financial decisions without requiring technical expertise.\n* The project bridges the gap between advanced financial analytics and everyday users through AI-driven automation.",
